      "id": "clm:3dc46fe07657328844730c1f1b54293a9d211159c46bd919bd04024465331cec",
      "text": "Percona warns that local engines may reject the OpenAI dimensions field and says to enable forwarding only for supporting models. Ollama independently lists dimensions among supported /v1/embeddings request fields. The generic Percona warning does not establish universal Ollama rejection. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-06)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/configure-automatic-embedding.html",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.ollama.com/api/openai-compatibility.md"
      ],
