    },
    {
      "id": "clm:aa9a29bc446b2e8ebc7ad74183f78807f2036e966a3f845ad50a83a9d088a4a4",
      "text": "Percona\u2019s reference defines batchSize as the maximum number of inputs per request, default 96, and batchTokenLimit as the approximate maximum input-token count per batch, default 120000. Its Ollama setup example explicitly supplies those values. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md",
