    {
      "id": "clm:0a4f5bce39ca3ef13e901c0d2d4577e6a82f3b53114aef03e7f5f2350aed54c1",
      "text": "Percona documents optional credentials.apiKey and default authHeaderName Authorization with the Bearer scheme; Azure OpenAI uses authHeaderName api-key. Keyless local engines can use credentials: {}. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md",
