      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:8419791ba40aa442ffd7f1b3372e18fd0dcda998e73fbfd6dd4500b9fcd61c5d",
      "text": "Percona marks config.errorHandlingConfig as required for OPENAI_COMPATIBLE models. maxRetries limits retry attempts; initialRetryWaitMs sets the first wait in milliseconds; maxRetryWaitMs caps waits in milliseconds; jitter randomizes the wait. The reference says authentication failures are not transient and are not retried. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.html"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:6ae6d488519e4317b83abe5a54336821342a7c9f83852bd39c2abf4f14fdbe9e",
        "ev:798577ad369bfd042624f8e3dea2353de5177d3223720cde6a85410b767fc8cb",
        "ev:d4fee72e9d3e6238395e4637906723d7e781c8f4fc37a115987430141b0508e5",
        "ev:dedca1b91d4ad5c56d4b3b8898d20576b3899372eb9a814e108c1205dbd3bf42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:9480396e27ea986415755750fcce0a375f6f36cbcb4ab41ddec19106792e15f1",
      "text": "Percona\u2019s Ollama setup example supplies maxRetries 10, initialRetryWaitMs 200, maxRetryWaitMs 10000, and jitter 0.1. These are example values; the reference describes the controls without declaring retry defaults. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md",
