    {
      "id": "clm:4bc2314643d9dd79365fad87082d4fef44b0e454ce4602ae430bde5b2a5b400c",
      "text": "Percona\u2019s keyless-local-engine configuration agrees with Ollama\u2019s local-server documentation, which says the OpenAI client requires an API-key value but Ollama ignores it. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-06)",
